"mike", "name": "Mike Pinsky", "pickNum": 2, "tribe": "toka"}, {"age": 24, "eliminatedWeek": 1, "from": "Providence, RI", "id": "aaliyah", "name": "Aaliyah Puglia", "pickNum": 10, "tribe": "toka"}, {"age": 34, "from": "Toronto, ON", "id": "ana", "name": "Ana Sani", "pickNum": 19, "tribe": "savu"}, {"age": 33, "from": "Los Angeles, CA", "id": "devin", "name": "Devin Way", "pickNum": 11, "tribe": "toka"}], "episodeNotes": [null, "We're back!! This season kicks off what Jeff Probst is calling the \"Open Era.\" Translation: any twist from the last 50 seasons can come back at any time.\n\n\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f THE START \n21 brand new players, nobody's played before. They all got dropped on one beach together and had to grab as many supplies as they could off the boat in 2 minutes before jumping in.\n\nThen they found a sign: pick ONE person to start the game alone on the other side of the island. Lewis volunteered like a hero... and got sent to Exile Island. That means no food, no info, and zero time bonding with anyone. In Survivor, bonding = votes, so that's rough. He also had a shot at a hidden immunity idol out there and couldn't get it out of the tree \ud83e\ude93\n\nEveryone else got split into 2 tribes: \n\ud83d\udc9c Savu (purple) \ud83d\udc9b Toka (yellow)\n\n\ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f FIRE-MAKING STAYS \nQuick context: when the game gets down to 4 players, 2 of them have to battle it out making fire to stay in. The players voted on whether to scrap it. Only 5 voted to get rid of it, so it stays.\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 THE BIG TWIST: THE COIN FLIP \nAt some point this season, one player gets to flip a coin. Call it right: they're safe, get an idol, and the prize jumps from $1M to $2M. Call it wrong: they're out on the spot, and that extra million rolls over to NEXT season. If nobody lands it, it keeps stacking every season.\n\n\ud83d\uddff IDOL ALERT \nRob (Savu) found a hidden immunity idol! An idol = you play it at Tribal and any votes against you don't count. His is good all the way until 5 players are left. \n\n\ud83c\udfc6 IMMUNITY CHALLENGE \nBig obstacle course with giant crates, then a puzzle. Savu won, so Toka had to go to Tribal Council and vote someone out.\n\n\ud83d\ude24 TOKA DRAMA \nJenna was the first target. People thought she was \"closed off\" and Devin didn't believe she was really a wedding photographer (she is). She's actually going through a divorce, which is why she was quiet. Patt noticed she crushed the puzzle and tried to save her. Then Jenna made a move: she told Brady that Aaliyah wanted him gone for being too \"aggressive.\" Brady got fired up and went after Aaliyah.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 TRIBAL COUNCIL It went LIVE, meaning players were openly whispering and scrambling during Tribal instead of just voting. Devin flat out said he was 100% voting Jenna.\n\nBoth Jenna and Aaliyah played their \"Shot in the Dark.\" That's a 1-in-6 gamble: you give up your vote for a small chance at safety. Neither worked.\nFinal vote 6-2...\n\n\ud83d\udc4b AALIYAH IS THE FIRST ONE OUT\n\n\ud83d\udc40 WHAT TO WATCH \n\u2022 Rob sitting on an idol \n\u2022 Devin being brutally honest (bold strategy) \n\u2022 Brady giving early villain vibes \n\u2022 Jenna + Patt teaming up \n\u2022 Lewis coming back with zero relationships"], "episodeStats": [null, {"aaliyah": {"votes": 6}, "alexis": {"immunity": true}, "ana": {"immunity": true}, "carter": {"immunity": true}, "cristian": {"immunity": true}, "eric": {"immunity": true}, "jenna": {"votes": 2}, "kristin": {"immunity": true}, "lewis": {"journey": true}, "linnea": {"immunity": true}, "ori": {"immunity": true}, "rob": {"idolFound": true, "immunity": true}, "sharonda": {"immunity": true}}], "episodeTitles": [null, "Permanent Uncertainty \ud83d\udd25"], "leagues": {"coloradoSprings": {"draftOrder": ["scott-anne", "claire-austin", "matt-aj"], "name": "Colorado Springs", "picks": {"aaliyah": ["claire-austin"], "alexis": ["matt-aj"], "ana": ["scott-anne"], "brady": ["scott-anne"], "carter": ["scott-a